nc_oc=AdocoAKawlWwSxpWpsWpEonaQyJbz6LmpcHwayhS2hRk0B1qRpvGuWcRTJvl_DTP-Jo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKcimTRGS-ad9LjwhDA3e6-YPF9tO8GHTLaCrKCIwI53g&oe=6A9AD93A"}, "display_name": "JAPAN ACTIVITY SIMULATOR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "There are over 28 different experiences based on the four paths of Bushido, Tea Ceremony, Flower Arrangement, and Calligraphy!\nAll activities are certified with ranks and titles!\n We have a wide variety of activities, from mindfulness activities like Samurai, Ninja, Tea Ceremony, Flower Arrangement, Kanji, Zazen, Hot Springs, and Sushi!\n We also have a wide variety of games and activities, from creative activities that express the soul to traditional Japanese games!\n{1119488606821638}\nRemove the tarnish from the sword and polish and align your mind as well\n{1184257777030409}\nEveryone is equal inside the tea room Regardless of rank, everyone should enter with their heads bowed\n{2944312539085173}\nArrange flowers of each season freely, and create whatever your heart desires, \nsuch as Chinese characters in ink paintings\n{1262677395914942}\nBeyond the 28+ activities, finding all the hidden \u201ckokeshi\u201ddolls will unlock a door to a new world", "short_description": "Experience the thrill of Japan\nUnder the moonlight, there is said to be a Japanese dojo that only those drawn by the spirit of Japan can reach..."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1187566356864951", "locale": "ja_JP", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "\u30b8\u30e3\u30d1\u30f3 \u30a2\u30af\u30c6\u30a3\u30d3\u30c6\u30a3 \u30b7\u30df\u30e5\u30ec\u30fc\u30bf\u30fc", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\u6b66\u58eb\u9053\u3001\u8336\u9053\u3001\u83ef\u9053\u3001\u66f8\u9053\u306e4\u3064\u306e\u9053\u3002\u4f53\u9a13\u3092\u30c6\u30fc\u30de\u306b\u7528\u610f\u3057\u305f\u30a2\u30af\u30c6\u30a3\u30d3\u30c6\u30a3\u30fb\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u306f28\u7a2e\u985e\u4ee5\u